    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "### What's a Prompt?\n\nA prompt is the message you send to an AI to tell it what to do.\n\nA good prompt tells the AI exactly what you need.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b76c07d9266cb7be1667d1626ab01f94-Gemini_Generated_Image_hfvnwjhfvnwjhfvn.png",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-93102ee9-aa96-4429-aafb-52f8fe7fd787",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### It's Like Ordering a Pizza\n\nWhat do you actually want? Be specific!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8e8348807e7cac851b805e8a06314bce-Gemini_Generated_Image_4xvjla4xvjla4xvj.png",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-e349bed8-89d6-4efc-8a0e-29b8a1e5afb1",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### Details matter\n\nIf you just say \"I want pizza,\" you might get something weird. But if you say, \"I want a medium pepperoni pizza\" perfect!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/16eae2ad1cb050884b5d273136b6e599-Gemini_Generated_Image_cclmnfcclmnfcclm.png",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-35731f8b-92f2-4309-954a-d8481cc58b14",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### Details Matter\n\nPrompts work the same way. The more useful info you give, the better the answer you get.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/05da8b88f2fc54e3dd50631142054cb2-Gemini_Generated_Image_aa8f9taa8f9taa8f.png",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info-0ae6fab6-0f3d-4751-bd68-31f5bc186f74",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_2026"
  },
